[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 17347.51, "timestamp": "04:49:07", "text": "以管理为生的人"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17349.75, "timestamp": "04:49:09", "text": "虽然压力很大，但我还是挺过来了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17352.07, "timestamp": "04:49:12", "text": "多个价值数百万美元的特许经营权"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17367.27, "timestamp": "04:49:27", "text": "找到一位经理很难"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17370.15, "timestamp": "04:49:30", "text": "诚实地，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17373.75, "timestamp": "04:49:33", "text": "但我也很乐意付钱给他们。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17376.15, "timestamp": "04:49:36", "text": "不知怎么的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17379.43, "timestamp": "04:49:39", "text": "我的意思是，你就像个小创作者。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17382.628, "timestamp": "04:49:42", "text": "嗯，如果你能找到一个愿意……的人"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17385.27, "timestamp": "04:49:45", "text": "自愿帮助你是件好事，但是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17388.708, "timestamp": "04:49:48", "text": "随着时间的推移，如果你在成长等等"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17391.91, "timestamp": "04:49:51", "text": "你必须付钱给他们。是的，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17394.628, "timestamp": "04:49:54", "text": "当然，我希望像这样支付员工薪水。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17397.67, "timestamp": "04:49:57", "text": "最初，当我有了版主时，"}]